  # adressing modes 
1.immediate addressing --> Mov R0,#0f3H
2.register addressing -->  Mov A,R0  || Mov Rn,A
3.direct adressing    ---> Mov A,30H
4.indirect adressing  ---->Mov A,@R0  (R0||R1)
5.index addressing    ----> Movc A,@A+DPTR      c-->code memeory

#8051 Instructions
1.data transfer   ---> Mov , Movx , Movc || XCH ,XCHD ||Push and pop
2.Logical      ------> cpl,clr,ANL,ORL,XRL,RLC,swap A    (biwise operations)
